@require: stdjabook
in
document (|
  title = {Capstone Rendering Test};
  author = {SATySFi in Rust};
  show-toc = false;
  show-title = true;
|) ?* '<
  +p {
    The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. This Latin paragraph is long
    enough that greedy line breaking wraps it onto several lines, driving the
    real StdJaBook document class end to end through the loader, elaboration,
    typechecking, evaluation, line breaking, page breaking, and PDF rendering.
  }
>
